            <div class="content-section">
                <div id="pgp-rise-tab1" class="content active">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30 active hideFortheMENA " data-rel="tab-a-1">
                        <div class="left ">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is a PG Programme in Human Resources & Organisation Strategy
                                (HR&OS)?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-1">A 16-month full-time postgraduate programme blending Masters’
                            Union’s business foundation with hands-on specialisations in human capital, organisational
                            design, leadership, and people analytics.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What will I learn in the Programme?

                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-2">Learn to build people strategies, design organisations, and
                            lead talent in a fast-changing business environment. Learn directly from top faculty, CHROs,
                            CXOs, and founders through live case studies, mentorship, and industry-led workshops. Our
                            “learn by doing” curriculum shapes future HR leaders at the intersection of people,
                            strategy, culture, and analytics.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading"> What is the program Structure?
                            </p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>

                        <div class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-a-3">
                            <p>
                                The curriculum spans 8 terms across 16 months</p>

                            <div class="detailsList faq-log">
                                <ul class="list">
                                    <li>
                                        <p>
                                            Terms 1–3 building core business foundations </p>
                                    </li>

                                    <li>
                                        <p>Terms 4-6 mastering human resources & organisation strategy. Capstone and consulting projects with real organisations</p>
                                    </li>

                      

                                </ul>

                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-a-4">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What will be the batch size of the class?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer" id="tab-a-4">We will limit the batch size to a maximum of 60 students to
                            ensure personalised learning, close mentorship from masters, and a highly effective
                            teacher–student ratio.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="pgp-rise-tab3" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is the eligibility criteria?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-1">The PGP in Human Resources & Organisation
                            Strategy is open to candidates who have completed their undergraduate degree or will
                            graduate by April 2026 onwards. Ideal applicants include fresh graduates, early-career
                            professionals (0–5 years), and professionals aspiring to build careers in people, culture,
                            and organisational leadership.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">How do I apply?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-2">Click <a href="/pgp-human-resources-organisation-strategy-applynow" class="link-red"> Apply
                                Now </a> (tag the application now link) on our website, complete the online application
                            form, and our admissions team will reach out to you at the earliest possible time.
                        </p>
                    </div>

