                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-6">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">If an application has been unsuccessful, may they reapply in the next
                                round?</p>

                            <img src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg"
                                class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-6">No, candidates cannot reapply in the next
                            round. They may reapply for the next intake in the following academic year by submitting a
                            new online application. It’s advisable to do so only if there have been significant updates
                            or improvements to their profile since the previous application.
                        </p>
                    </div>


